===== Specific Configuration =====
==== Power over ethernet pass-through ====

PoE pass-through is disabled by default.
It can be enabled using "echo 1 > /sys/class/gpio/poe-passthrough/value".  To make this setting permanent, you'll have to add an initscript for this.

