==== Serial ====
There is a 4 pin UART serial port on the bottom right corner of the board (if you see it with USB and RJ45 at top), could be marked as "J44" (don't get wrong with the other that is JTAG). The pins are numbered from 1 to 4:

  -  VCC
  -  RX
  -  TX
  -  GND

